  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "yes",
  "summary": "Humanity's future will be defined by a series of severe trials in the near-term, primarily climate change and the rise of AGI, which will force radical adaptation. If we survive this bottleneck, our descendants will embark on a path of technological and biological transformation, becoming a multi-planetary and eventually multi-form species whose definition of 'human' is vastly different from our own."
